    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Protein AGENCY is a London-based cultural insight, foresight and strategy consultancy founded in 1997 by William Rowe. One of four divisions under Protein Holdings Ltd (Shoreditch), alongside XYZ (cultural intelligence membership), STUDIOS (event space/coworking), and OS (cultural dashboard). Core offering: qualitative/quantitative consumer research and brand strategy for global premium clients including Nike, Apple, Chanel, TikTok, Lululemon and Pernod Ricard. Work spans cultural briefings, ethnographic research, Gen Z audience studies, and brand activation strategy. Team size confirmed at 11-50 on LinkedIn (Companies House listed 21 employees at dissolution of the former UK entity in 2023). Classified Agency not Studio: large, full-service, strategy-at-scale operation. Insights & research added alongside Brand strategy: their methodology is explicitly research-first (SEED CLUB network of 450+ curators). Sources checked: proteinagency.com, protein.co.uk, LinkedIn company page, Companies House records.",
